	~	Mio CHF
	~	[RoCH] Federal RUG spending of the rest of Switzerland: Ticino spending x \
		(1/0.0272 - 1) in the runs with PV rebate federal = 0 ... 0.4 and cantonal \
		incentives at base value.
	|

RoCH federal RUP=
	SUM(Rebate interpolation weight[Rebate point!]*RoCH federal RUP data[Rebate point!])
	~	Mio CHF
	~	[RoCH] Federal RUP spending of the rest of Switzerland interpolated in PV \
		rebate federal.
	|

RoCH federal RUP data[RP00]=
	WITH LOOKUP(Time, ([(2000,-1e+09)-(2100,1e+09)],(2011,0),(2012,0),(2013,0),(2014,109.042\
		),(2015,147.885),(2016,108.898),(2017,91.7968),(2018,96.0353),(2019,89.4023),(2020,\
