		)^(-(PV lifetime)))/Interest rate)
	~	CHF
	~	[CORE M01/E08] Utility of the best available regime (normalised 30-year \
		return, same scale as PV Eco Utility).
	|

Study RU[District,Type]=
	IF THEN ELSE( Time>=2014 :AND: kWp installed per building[District,Type]<30 , PV federal subsidy check\
		[District,Type] , 
	IF THEN ELSE( Time>=2013 :AND: kWp installed per building[District,Type]<30 , MIN(1500\
		+1000*kWp installed per building[District,Type] , 0.3*PV investment cost[District,Type\
		])*(1+Interest rate)^(-Study RU 2013 payment wait), 0))
	~	CHF
	~	[CORE M01/E08] Historical PV economics 2011-2017: ordinary sale, RU/CU, \
		federal RIC with waiting list, TI programme.
	|

Probability adoption RCP Owners[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
