		[District,HS,Performance,Type], Decision probability PV Renters[District,HS,Performance\
		,Type])
	~	Dmnl
	~		|

Study TI factor=
	((1-(1+Interest rate )^(-16))/Interest rate) - ((1-(1+Interest rate)^(-(MIN(16,Study TI wait\
		))))/Interest rate)
	~	year
	~	[CORE M01/E08] Historical PV economics 2011-2017: ordinary sale, RU/CU, \
		federal RIC with waiting list, TI programme.
