Concern coefficient=
	0.682943
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE E14/E15] Weight of the energy-concern signal in the PV/RCP/RCPv \
		adoption utility (log-odds per 10 points of concern). To be calibrated, \
		bounds [-2,2]; E14-E17 estimates 0.57-0.98. With 0 the mechanism is \
		inactive.
	|

Study self consumption start year=
	2013
	~	year
	~	[CORE-PV] First year with self-consumption in the historical economics \
		(SURE_core 2014).
