Study admission mode=
	3
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE-PV] 0 = federal RIC admission probability constant (Study admission \
		probability); 1 = admission probability by year of decision (Study federal \
		admission 2011 declining linearly to 0 at Study federal admission end \
		year). Rationale: RIC waiting list (UFE 11.11.2015:
	|

Calibration end year=
	2025
	~	year
	~	[CORE-PV] Last year included in the PV log-likelihoods (2024 = fit to \
		2024, 2025 = fit incl. 2025).
