		,Type])/Study cost RU[District,Type]/PV lifetime*100
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE M01/E08] Utility of the best available regime (normalised 30-year \
		return, same scale as PV Eco Utility).
	|

Study current Owners federal utility[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	IF THEN ELSE(Time>=2014 :AND: kWp installed per building[District,Type]<10,
	-1000,(Study current Owners ordinary PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]+Study federal admission probability\
		*Study exported kWh Owners[District,HS,Performance,Type]*(Study RIC tariff[District\
		,Type]-Exp expected export price)*Study federal factor-Study cost without RU[District\
		,Type])/Study cost without RU[District,Type]/PV lifetime*100)
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE M01/E08] Utility of the best available regime (normalised 30-year \
		return, same scale as PV Eco Utility).
	|

Study current Owners TI utility[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	IF THEN ELSE(Time>=2014 :AND: Time<2018 :AND: kWp installed per building[District,Type\
		]>=10 :AND: kWp installed per building[District,Type]<30,
	(Study current Owners ordinary PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]+Study TI admission probability\
		*Study exported kWh Owners[District,HS,Performance,Type]*(Study RIC tariff[District\
		,Type]-Exp expected export price)*Study TI factor-Study cost without RU[District,Type\
		])/Study cost without RU[District,Type]/PV lifetime*100,
	-1000)
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE M01/E08] Utility of the best available regime (normalised 30-year \
		return, same scale as PV Eco Utility).
	|

Study current Owners TI RU utility[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	IF THEN ELSE(Time>=2014 :AND: Time<2018 :AND: kWp installed per building[District,Type\
		]>=10 :AND: kWp installed per building[District,Type]<30,
	(Study current Owners ordinary PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]+Study TI admission probability\
		*(MAX(0,
	Study exported kWh Owners[District,HS,Performance,Type]*Study RIC tariff[District,Type\
		]-Study TI annual offset[District,Type])-Study exported kWh Owners[District,HS,Performance\
		,Type]*Exp expected export price)*Study TI factor-Study cost RU[District,Type])/Study cost RU\
		[District,Type]/PV lifetime*100,
	-1000)
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE M01/E08] Utility of the best available regime (normalised 30-year \
		return, same scale as PV Eco Utility).
	|

Study current Owners historical utility[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	MAX(MAX(Study current Owners ordinary utility[District,HS,Performance,Type],
	Study current Owners federal utility[District,HS,Performance,Type]),MAX(Study current Owners TI utility\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type],
	Study current Owners TI RU utility[District,HS,Performance,Type]))
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE M01/E08] Utility of the best available regime (normalised 30-year \
		return, same scale as PV Eco Utility).
	|

Study self consumption Renter[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	0
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE M01/E08] Utility of the best available regime (normalised 30-year \
		return, same scale as PV Eco Utility).
	|

Study exported kWh Renter[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	PV annual generation per building[District,Type]*(1-Study self consumption Renter[District\
		,HS,Performance,Type])
	~	kWh/year
	~	[CORE M01/E08] Utility of the best available regime (normalised 30-year \
		return, same scale as PV Eco Utility).
	|

Study current Renter ordinary cash[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	PV annual generation per building[District,Type]*(Study self consumption Renter[District\
		,HS,Performance,Type]*Electricity price[District]-PV annual mantainance cost)+Study exported kWh Renter\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]*Exp expected export price
	~	CHF/year
	~	[CORE M01/E08] Utility of the best available regime (normalised 30-year \
		return, same scale as PV Eco Utility).
	|

Study current Renter ordinary utility[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	(Study current Renter ordinary PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]-Study cost RU[District\
		,Type])/Study cost RU[District,Type]/PV lifetime*100
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE M01/E08] Utility of the best available regime (normalised 30-year \
		return, same scale as PV Eco Utility).
	|

Study current Renter federal utility[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	IF THEN ELSE(Time>=2014 :AND: kWp installed per building[District,Type]<10,
	-1000,(Study current Renter ordinary PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]+Study federal admission probability\
		*Study exported kWh Renter[District,HS,Performance,Type]*(Study RIC tariff[District\
		,Type]-Exp expected export price)*Study federal factor-Study cost without RU[District\
		,Type])/Study cost without RU[District,Type]/PV lifetime*100)
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE M01/E08] Utility of the best available regime (normalised 30-year \
		return, same scale as PV Eco Utility).
	|

Study current Renter TI utility[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	IF THEN ELSE(Time>=2014 :AND: Time<2018 :AND: kWp installed per building[District,Type\
		]>=10 :AND: kWp installed per building[District,Type]<30,
	(Study current Renter ordinary PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]+Study TI admission probability\
		*Study exported kWh Renter[District,HS,Performance,Type]*(Study RIC tariff[District\
		,Type]-Exp expected export price)*Study TI factor-Study cost without RU[District,Type\
		])/Study cost without RU[District,Type]/PV lifetime*100,
	-1000)
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE M01/E08] Utility of the best available regime (normalised 30-year \
		return, same scale as PV Eco Utility).
	|

Study current Renter TI RU utility[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	IF THEN ELSE(Time>=2014 :AND: Time<2018 :AND: kWp installed per building[District,Type\
		]>=10 :AND: kWp installed per building[District,Type]<30,
	(Study current Renter ordinary PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]+Study TI admission probability\
		*(MAX(0,
	Study exported kWh Renter[District,HS,Performance,Type]*Study RIC tariff[District,Type\
		]-Study TI annual offset[District,Type])-Study exported kWh Renter[District,HS,Performance\
		,Type]*Exp expected export price)*Study TI factor-Study cost RU[District,Type])/Study cost RU\
		[District,Type]/PV lifetime*100,
	-1000)
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE M01/E08] Utility of the best available regime (normalised 30-year \
		return, same scale as PV Eco Utility).
	|

Study current Renter historical utility[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	MAX(MAX(Study current Renter ordinary utility[District,HS,Performance,Type],
	Study current Renter federal utility[District,HS,Performance,Type]),MAX(Study current Renter TI utility\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type],
	Study current Renter TI RU utility[District,HS,Performance,Type]))
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE M01/E08] Utility of the best available regime (normalised 30-year \
		return, same scale as PV Eco Utility).
	|

Calendar enabled=
	1
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE M04] 1 = adoptions are realised after a preparation time (orders -> \
		completions); 0 = original immediate acceptance.
	|

Calendar preparation months=
	3
	~	month
	~	[CORE M04] Average preparation time between order and commissioning \
		(E07-E19 reference: 3 months).
	|

Calendar ready share=
	1-Calendar preparation months/12
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE M04] Share of the orders of a year that can be commissioned in the \
		same year (orders spread uniformly over the year).
	|

Calendar pending total[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	Calendar pending Owners PV[District,HS,Performance,Type] + Calendar pending Owners RCP\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type] + Calendar pending Owners RCPv[District,HS,Performance\
		,Type] + Calendar pending Renters PV[District,HS,Performance,Type] + Calendar pending Renters RCP\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type] + Calendar pending Renters RCPv[District,HS,Performance\
		,Type]
	~	building
	~	[CORE M04] Orders placed but not yet commissioned.
	|

Calendar retention[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	IF THEN ELSE(Calendar pending total[District,HS,Performance,Type]>0, MIN(1,Available PV adoption\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]/Calendar pending total[District,HS,Performance,Type]\
		),1)
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE M04] Share of pending orders still feasible (buildings still \
		available); the rest is cancelled.
	|

Calendar order fraction[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	MIN(1, ZIDZ(Available PV adoption[District,HS,Performance,Type], Total PV request[District\
		,HS,Performance,Type])) * MAX(0,
	1-XIDZ(Calendar pending total[District,HS,Performance,Type], Available PV adoption[District\
		,HS,Performance,Type], 1))
	~	Dmnl
	~	[CORE M04] Requests turned into new orders: limited by available buildings \
		and net of buildings that already have an order pending (no double \
		counting). XIDZ(...,1): with (almost) no available buildings no new \
		orders are placed, so completions never exceed the source stock.
	|

Calendar orders Owners PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	MAX(0, Requested Owners adopting PV[District,HS,Performance,Type])*Calendar order fraction\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]
	~	building/year
	~	[CORE M04] New orders of the year.
	|

Calendar pending Owners PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	INTEG(Calendar orders Owners PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]*(1-Calendar ready share\
		)-Calendar pending Owners PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]/TIME STEP,
	0)
	~	building
	~	[CORE M04] Orders of the previous year not yet commissioned at the start \
		of the year.
	|

Calendar completed Owners PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	Calendar ready share*Calendar orders Owners PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]+Calendar retention\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]*Calendar pending Owners PV[District,HS,Performance,Type\
		]/TIME STEP
	~	building/year
	~	[CORE M04] Commissioned installations: share ready in the order year + \
		pending orders of the previous year.
	|

Calendar orders Owners RCP[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	MAX(0, Requested Owners adopting RCP[District,HS,Performance,Type])*Calendar order fraction\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]
	~	building/year
	~	[CORE M04] New orders of the year.
	|

Calendar pending Owners RCP[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	INTEG(Calendar orders Owners RCP[District,HS,Performance,Type]*(1-Calendar ready share\
		)-Calendar pending Owners RCP[District,HS,Performance,Type]/TIME STEP,
	0)
	~	building
	~	[CORE M04] Orders of the previous year not yet commissioned at the start \
		of the year.
	|

Calendar completed Owners RCP[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	Calendar ready share*Calendar orders Owners RCP[District,HS,Performance,Type]+Calendar retention\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]*Calendar pending Owners RCP[District,HS,Performance,\
		Type]/TIME STEP
	~	building/year
	~	[CORE M04] Commissioned installations: share ready in the order year + \
		pending orders of the previous year.
	|

Calendar orders Owners RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	MAX(0, Requested Owners adopting RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type])*Calendar order fraction\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]
	~	building/year
	~	[CORE M04] New orders of the year.
	|

Calendar pending Owners RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	INTEG(Calendar orders Owners RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]*(1-Calendar ready share\
		)-Calendar pending Owners RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]/TIME STEP,
	0)
	~	building
	~	[CORE M04] Orders of the previous year not yet commissioned at the start \
		of the year.
	|

Calendar completed Owners RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	Calendar ready share*Calendar orders Owners RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]+Calendar retention\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]*Calendar pending Owners RCPv[District,HS,Performance\
		,Type]/TIME STEP
	~	building/year
	~	[CORE M04] Commissioned installations: share ready in the order year + \
		pending orders of the previous year.
	|

Calendar orders Renters PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	MAX(0, Requested Renters adopting PV[District,HS,Performance,Type])*Calendar order fraction\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]
	~	building/year
	~	[CORE M04] New orders of the year.
	|

Calendar pending Renters PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	INTEG(Calendar orders Renters PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]*(1-Calendar ready share\
		)-Calendar pending Renters PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]/TIME STEP,
	0)
	~	building
	~	[CORE M04] Orders of the previous year not yet commissioned at the start \
		of the year.
	|

Calendar completed Renters PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	Calendar ready share*Calendar orders Renters PV[District,HS,Performance,Type]+Calendar retention\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]*Calendar pending Renters PV[District,HS,Performance,\
		Type]/TIME STEP
	~	building/year
	~	[CORE M04] Commissioned installations: share ready in the order year + \
		pending orders of the previous year.
	|

Calendar orders Renters RCP[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	MAX(0, Requested Renters adopting RCP[District,HS,Performance,Type])*Calendar order fraction\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]
	~	building/year
	~	[CORE M04] New orders of the year.
	|

Calendar pending Renters RCP[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	INTEG(Calendar orders Renters RCP[District,HS,Performance,Type]*(1-Calendar ready share\
		)-Calendar pending Renters RCP[District,HS,Performance,Type]/TIME STEP,
	0)
	~	building
	~	[CORE M04] Orders of the previous year not yet commissioned at the start \
		of the year.
	|

Calendar completed Renters RCP[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	Calendar ready share*Calendar orders Renters RCP[District,HS,Performance,Type]+Calendar retention\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]*Calendar pending Renters RCP[District,HS,Performance\
		,Type]/TIME STEP
	~	building/year
	~	[CORE M04] Commissioned installations: share ready in the order year + \
		pending orders of the previous year.
	|

Calendar orders Renters RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	MAX(0, Requested Renters adopting RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type])*Calendar order fraction\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]
	~	building/year
	~	[CORE M04] New orders of the year.
	|

Calendar pending Renters RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	INTEG(Calendar orders Renters RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]*(1-Calendar ready share\
		)-Calendar pending Renters RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]/TIME STEP,
	0)
	~	building
	~	[CORE M04] Orders of the previous year not yet commissioned at the start \
		of the year.
	|

Calendar completed Renters RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	Calendar ready share*Calendar orders Renters RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]+Calendar retention\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]*Calendar pending Renters RCPv[District,HS,Performance\
		,Type]/TIME STEP
	~	building/year
	~	[CORE M04] Commissioned installations: share ready in the order year + \
		pending orders of the previous year.
	|

Calendar pending count=
	SUM(Calendar pending total[District!,HS!,Performance!,Type!])
	~	building
	~	[CORE M04] Diagnostic.
	|

Calendar cancelled count=
	SUM(Calendar pending total[District!,HS!,Performance!,Type!]*(1-Calendar retention[District\
		!,HS!,Performance!,Type!]))
	~	building/year
	~	[CORE M04] Diagnostic: orders cancelled because buildings are no longer \
		available.
	|

PV adoptions by archetype legacy[District,HS,Performance,Type,Battery]=
	DELAY FIXED(New buildings installing PV[District,HS,Performance,Type,Battery]+Consumers adopting PV yes with battery\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type,PVyes,Battery],
	0.01,0)
	~	building/year
	~	[CORE E07] Original 0.01-year DELAY FIXED, used only with Calendar enabled \
		= 0 (must be a separate level).
	|

RCPv adoptions by archetype legacy[District,HS,Performance,Type,Battery]=
	DELAY FIXED(Consumers adopting RCPv yes with battery[District,HS,Performance,Type,PVyes\
		,Battery],
	0.01,0)
	~	building/year
	~	[CORE E07] Original 0.01-year DELAY FIXED, used only with Calendar enabled \
		= 0.
	|

Battery generation[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	kWp installed per building[District,Type]*PV annual generation per kW
	~	kWh/year
	~	[CORE E19] Physically consistent battery balance: direct use, charging, \
		delivered energy and losses bounded by production and demand.
	|

Battery direct use[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	MIN(El consumption per building[District,HS,Performance,Type],MIN(Battery generation\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type],
	MAX(0,Battery generation[District,HS,Performance,Type]*Self consumption degree[District\
		,HS,Performance,Type])))
	~	kWh/year
	~	[CORE E19] Physically consistent battery balance: direct use, charging, \
		delivered energy and losses bounded by production and demand.
	|

Battery charging[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	MIN(Battery generation[District,HS,Performance,Type]-Battery direct use[District,HS,\
		Performance,Type],
	MIN((El consumption per building[District,HS,Performance,Type]-Battery direct use[District\
		,HS,Performance,Type])/Decentralized storage efficiency,
	MAX(0,Battery generation[District,HS,Performance,Type]*(Self consumption degree with Storage\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]-Self consumption degree[District,HS,Performance,Type\
		]))))
	~	kWh/year
	~	[CORE E19] Physically consistent battery balance: direct use, charging, \
		delivered energy and losses bounded by production and demand.
	|

Battery delivered[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	Battery charging[District,HS,Performance,Type]*Decentralized storage efficiency
	~	kWh/year
	~	[CORE E19] Physically consistent battery balance: direct use, charging, \
		delivered energy and losses bounded by production and demand.
	|

Battery loss[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	Battery charging[District,HS,Performance,Type]-Battery delivered[District,HS,Performance\
		,Type]
	~	kWh/year
	~	[CORE E19] Physically consistent battery balance: direct use, charging, \
		delivered energy and losses bounded by production and demand.
	|

Battery generation RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	kWp installed per building RCPv[District,Type]*PV annual generation per kW
	~	kWh/year
	~	[CORE E19] Physically consistent battery balance: direct use, charging, \
		delivered energy and losses bounded by production and demand.
	|

Battery direct use RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	MIN(El consumption per building[District,HS,Performance,Type],MIN(Battery generation RCPv\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type],
	MAX(0,Battery generation RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]*Self consumption degree RCPv\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type])))
	~	kWh/year
	~	[CORE E19] Physically consistent battery balance: direct use, charging, \
		delivered energy and losses bounded by production and demand.
	|

Battery charging RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	MIN(Battery generation RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]-Battery direct use RCPv[District\
		,HS,Performance,Type],
	MIN((El consumption per building[District,HS,Performance,Type]-Battery direct use RCPv\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type])/Decentralized storage efficiency,
	MAX(0,Battery generation RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]*(Self consumption degree with Storage RCPv\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]-Self consumption degree RCPv[District,HS,Performance\
		,Type]))))
	~	kWh/year
	~	[CORE E19] Physically consistent battery balance: direct use, charging, \
		delivered energy and losses bounded by production and demand.
	|

Battery delivered RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	Battery charging RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]*Decentralized storage efficiency
	~	kWh/year
	~	[CORE E19] Physically consistent battery balance: direct use, charging, \
		delivered energy and losses bounded by production and demand.
	|

Battery loss RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	Battery charging RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type]-Battery delivered RCPv[District,\
		HS,Performance,Type]
	~	kWh/year
	~	[CORE E19] Physically consistent battery balance: direct use, charging, \
		delivered energy and losses bounded by production and demand.
	|

Battery annual loss added[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	IF THEN ELSE(Time<2015,0,PV adoptions by archetype[District,HS,Performance,Type,Byes\
		]*Battery loss[District,HS,Performance,Type]+RCPv adoptions by archetype[District,HS\
		,Performance,Type,Byes]*Battery loss RCPv[District,HS,Performance,Type])
	~	kWh/year/year
	~	[CORE E19] Physically consistent battery balance: direct use, charging, \
		delivered energy and losses bounded by production and demand.
	|

Battery annual loss installed[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	INTEG(Battery annual loss added[District,HS,Performance,Type]-Battery annual loss installed\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type]*PV removal fraction[District,HS,Performance,Type],
	0)
	~	kWh/year
	~	[CORE E19] Physically consistent battery balance: direct use, charging, \
		delivered energy and losses bounded by production and demand.
	|

Battery residential losses GWh=
	SUM(Battery annual loss installed[District!,HS!,Performance!,Type!])/1e+06
	~	GWh/year
	~	[CORE E19] Storage losses removed from PV production fed to the grid.
	|

PV buildings[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	SUM(Heating Solution[District,HS,Performance,Type,PVyes,Battery!])
	~	building
	~	[CORE E19] Buildings with PV, used for the removal fraction of installed \
		battery losses.
	|

PV removal fraction[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	IF THEN ELSE(PV buildings[District,HS,Performance,Type]>1e-10,MIN(1/TIME STEP,
	SUM(Building demolition by archetype[District,HS,Performance,Type,PVyes,Battery!])/IF THEN ELSE\
		(PV buildings[District,HS,Performance,Type]>1e-10,
	PV buildings[District,HS,Performance,Type],1)),0)
	~	1/year
	~	[CORE E19] Share of PV buildings demolished in the year. Stocks at or below 1e-10 buildings are numerical zero.
	|

Dispatchable supply by supplier[Month,Hour,Supplier]=
	MAX(0, Hourly available supply by Supplier[Month,Hour,Supplier])
	~	
	~	[CORE dispatch] Non-negative capacity offered to dispatch.
	|

Electricity dispatch balance error[Month,Hour]=
	SUM(Electricity dispatched[Month,Hour,Supplier!]) - MIN(Hourly demand and PHS[Month,\
		Hour],
	SUM(Dispatchable supply by supplier[Month,Hour,Supplier!]))
	~	
	~	[CORE dispatch] Diagnostic: zero when dispatch equals demand capped by \
		capacity.
	|

Unserved hourly electricity[Month,Hour]=
	MAX(0, Hourly demand and PHS[Month,Hour] - SUM(Electricity dispatched[Month,Hour,Supplier\
		!]))
	~	
	~	[CORE dispatch] Diagnostic: demand not served.
	|

PV SC check=
	SUM(PV Hourly SC computed[Month!,Hour!]) * 365 / 12
	~	
	~		|

Hourly electricity grid demand[Month,Hour]=
	IF THEN ELSE( PV Hourly SC computed[Month,Hour] < Hourly electricity demand[Month,Hour\
		] , Hourly electricity demand[Month,Hour] - PV Hourly SC computed[Month,Hour] , 0 )
	~	
	~		|

Hourly el demand with PV[Month,Hour]=
	Hourly electricity demand[Month,Hour] * Share of buildings with PV
	~	
	~		|

PV hour SC[Month,Hour]=
	MIN( PV hourly production[Month,Hour] , Hourly el demand with PV[Month,Hour] )
	~	
	~		|

PV Hourly SC computed[Month,Hour]=
	Total PV electricity SC * PV hour SC[Month,Hour] / SUM(PV hour SC[Month!,Hour!]) / (\
		 365 / 12 )
	~	
	~		|

Building demolition by archetype[District,HS,VeryLow,Type,PVpanel,Battery]=
	Res VeryLow demolition[District,Type] * Share HS by archetype[District,HS,VeryLow,Type\
		,PVpanel,Battery] ~~|
Building demolition by archetype[District,HS,Performance,Type,PVpanel,Battery] :EXCEPT:\
		  [District,HS,VeryLow,Type,PVpanel,Battery]=
	0
	~	
	~		|

Total PV kWh SC[District,HS,Performance,Type]= INTEG (
	Additional annual PV kWh SC[District,HS,Performance,Type]-PV kWh SC demolished[District\
		,HS,Performance,Type],
		0)
	~	kWh
	~		|

PV kW installed Residential[District,HS,Performance,Type]= INTEG (
	Annual PV kW installation[District,HS,Performance,Type] - PV kW Residential demolished\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type],
		Initial kWp installed by archetype[District,HS,Performance,Type])
	~	kW
	~		|

Annual CO2 tax archetype[District,HS,Performance,Type,PVpanel] :EXCEPT:  [District,NonRenSolution\
		,Performance,Type,PVpanel]=
	0 ~~|
Annual CO2 tax archetype[District,Oil,Performance,Type,PVpanel]=
	( Annual DHW demand[District,Type] * SUM(Heating Solution[District,Oil,Performance,Type\
		,PVpanel,Battery!]) +
	
	Annual SH demand[District,Performance,Type] * Annual heating degree days coefficient\
		 * SUM(Heating Solution[District,Oil,Performance,Type,PVpanel,Battery!]) ) / Efficiency\
		[OilBoiler] * CO2 tax * 0.00026532 ~~|
Annual CO2 tax archetype[District,OilST,Performance,Type,PVpanel]=
	( Annual SH demand[District,Performance,Type] * Annual heating degree days coefficient\
		 * SUM(Heating Solution[District,Oil,Performance,Type,PVpanel,Battery!]) ) / Efficiency\
		[OilBoiler] * CO2 tax * 0.00026532 ~~|
Annual CO2 tax archetype[District,Gas,Performance,Type,PVpanel]=
	( Annual DHW demand[District,Type] * SUM(Heating Solution[District,Gas,Performance,Type\
		,PVpanel,Battery!]) +
	
	Annual SH demand[District,Performance,Type] * Annual heating degree days coefficient\
		 * SUM(Heating Solution[District,Gas,Performance,Type,PVpanel,Battery!]) ) / Efficiency\
		[GasBoiler] * CO2 tax * 0.0002016 ~~|
Annual CO2 tax archetype[District,GasST,Performance,Type,PVpanel]=
	( Annual SH demand[District,Performance,Type] * Annual heating degree days coefficient\
		 * SUM(Heating Solution[District,GasST,Performance,Type,PVpanel,Battery!]) ) / Efficiency\
		[GasBoiler] * CO2 tax * 0.0002016 ~~|
Annual CO2 tax archetype[District,ElectricHeater,Performance,Type,PVpanel]=
	0
	~	CHF
	~		|

PV kWh SC demolished[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	PV kWh self consumed demolished[District,HS,Performance,Type]
	~	
	~		|

PV kWh self consumed[District,HS,Performance,Type]= INTEG (
	Additional annual PV kWh self consumed[District,HS,Performance,Type]-PV kWh self consumed demolished\
		[District,HS,Performance,Type],
		0)
	~	kWh
	~		|

PV kWh self consumed demolished[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	IF THEN ELSE( Time < 2015 , 0 , SUM(Building demolition by archetype[District,HS,Performance\
		,Type,PVyes,Battery!]) * kWp installed per building[District,Type] * PV annual generation per kW\
		 * Self consumption degree[District,HS,Performance,Type] )
	~	
	~		|

PV kW Residential demolished[District,HS,Performance,Type]=
	SUM(Building demolition by archetype[District,HS,Performance,Type,PVyes,Battery!]) *\
		 kWp installed per building[District,Type]
	~	
	~		|

Requested Owners adopting RCP[District,HS,Performance,Type] :EXCEPT:    [District,HS,\
		Performance,MFH]=
	0 ~~|
Requested Owners adopting RCP[District,HS,Performance,MFH]=
	MAX( IF THEN ELSE( Time < 2018 , 0 , 
	
	IF THEN ELSE( Time < 2025 , 
	
	( SUM(Heating Solution[District,HS,Performance,MFH,PVpanel!,Battery!]) * Share of buildings with suitable roof\
		[District,MFH] * Share of owned houses[MFH] - 
	SUM(Heating Solution[District,HS,Performance,MFH,PVyes,Battery!]) * ( Owned buildings with PV\
		[District,MFH] + Owned buildings with RCP[District,MFH] + Owned buildings with RCPv\
		[District,MFH] ) / SUM(Heating Solution[District,HS!,Performance!,MFH,PVyes,Battery\
		!]) ) * 
	Probability adoption RCP Owners[District,HS,Performance,MFH] , 
	
	( SUM(Heating Solution[District,HS,Performance,MFH,PVpanel!,Battery!]) * Share of buildings with suitable roof\
		[District,MFH] * Share of owned houses[MFH] - 
	SUM(Heating Solution[District,HS,Performance,MFH,PVyes,Battery!]) * ( Owned buildings with PV\
		[District,MFH] + Owned buildings with RCP[District,MFH] + Owned buildings with RCPv\
		[District,MFH] + Owned buildings with RCPv PVno[District,MFH] ) / SUM(Heating Solution\
		[District,HS!,Performance!,MFH,PVyes,Battery!]) ) * 
	Probability adoption RCP Owners[District,HS,Performance,MFH] * ( 1 - Share urban buildings\
		[District,MFH] ) * Energy Community scenario -
	
	( SUM(Heating Solution[District,HS,Performance,MFH,PVpanel!,Battery!]) * Share of buildings with suitable roof\
		[District,MFH] * Share of owned houses[MFH] - 
	SUM(Heating Solution[District,HS,Performance,MFH,PVyes,Battery!]) * ( Owned buildings with PV\
		[District,MFH] + Owned buildings with RCP[District,MFH] + Owned buildings with RCPv\
		[District,MFH] + Owned buildings with RCPv PVno[District,MFH] ) / SUM(Heating Solution\
		[District,HS!,Performance!,MFH,PVyes,Battery!]) ) * 
	Probability adoption RCP Owners[District,HS,Performance,MFH] * ( Energy Community scenario\
		 - 1 ) ) ) , 0 )
	~	
	~		|

