		IF THEN ELSE(Time < 2021.1, 100,
		
		IF THEN ELSE(Time < 2030 , 180 , 180 ) ) )
	|

Emissions per capacity installed[OilBoiler]=
	21.1 ~~|
Emissions per capacity installed[GasBoiler]=
	21.1 ~~|
Emissions per capacity installed[PelletBoiler]=
	21.1 ~~|
